%% AI tool execution (controlled)
flowchart TD
    LLM[LLM proposes tool call] --> AUTHZ{Tool authorized?}
    AUTHZ -- no --> BLOCK[Reject + audit]
    AUTHZ -- yes --> VAL{Args valid vs schema?}
    VAL -- no --> BLOCK
    VAL -- yes --> TO[Apply timeout + retry policy]
    TO --> RUN[Execute deterministic tool]
    RUN --> RES[Structured result]
    RES --> AUD[Audit event]
    AUD --> LLM
    note1[[LLM has no arbitrary shell/network/DB access]]
